@startuml
title Сценарий 1: Кабинет рекламодателя


actor "Рекламодатель" as Advertiser

participant "API\n Gateway" as GW
participant "Istio\n Sidecar\n (BFF)" as BFFISTIO
box "Advertiser BFF" #F4D6F4
    participant "Advertiser\n Cache\n Replica" as BFFCREP
    participant "Advertiser\n Cache\n Primary" as BFFC
    participant "Advertiser\n BFF" as BFF
end box

box "События" #FFE8E8
    queue "Kafka" as K
    queue "RabbitMQ" as RQ
end box
participant "Istio\n Sidecar\n (Financial)" as FSISTIO

participant "Istio\n Sidecar\n (Campaign)" as CSISTIO
box "Campaign Service" #E8F1FF
    participant "Campaign\n BL" as CSBL
    database "Campaign\n DB Replica" as CSDBREP
    database "Campaign\n DB Primary" as CSDB
    participant "Campaign\n API" as CSAPI
end box

participant "Istio\n Sidecar\n (Analytics)" as AAISTIO
box "Analytics Service" #FFF4D6
    participant "Analytics\n Worker\n Cluster" as AW
    participant "Reports\n Worker\n Cluster" as RW
    database "ClickHouse\n Replica" as CHREP
    database "ClickHouse\n Primary" as CH
    participant "Analytics\n API" as AAAPI
end box




== Просмотр кабинета ==

Advertiser -> GW++: [1.1] HTTPS: запрос открытия кабинета
    GW -> BFFISTIO++: [1.2] HTTPS over mTLS (Istio)
       BFFISTIO -> BFF++: [1.3] HTTPS: запрос стартовой страницы
            BFF -> BFFCREP++: [1.4] Internal Call:\n получить закэшированные данные рекламодателя
            BFFCREP --> BFF--: dashboard (профиль, баланс, список кампаний, агрегаты)

            alt Если данные устарели/отсуствуют, то параллельные запросы BFF к сервисам в этими данными
                par timeout 2s, retry 2x, CB 50%/30s
                    BFF -> CSISTIO++: [1.4.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio): GET campaign
                        note right of CSISTIO: cм. Управление кампаниями
                    CSISTIO --> BFF--: сampaigns
                else timeout 2s, retry 2x, CB 50%/30s
                    BFF -> AAISTIO++: [1.4.2] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio): GET aggregates
                        note right of AAISTIO: cм. Просмотр аналитики
                    AAISTIO --> BFF--: aggregates
                else timeout 2s, retry 2x, CB 50%/30s
                    BFF -> FSISTIO++: [1.4.3] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio): GET budgets
                        note left of FSISTIO: cм. Просмотр финансов
                    FSISTIO --> BFF--: budgets
                end
                BFF -> BFFC++: [1.4.4.1] Internal Call:\n запись в кэш исходных данных
                BFFC --> BFF--: saved
                BFF -> BFF: [1.4.4.2] вычисление dashboard
                BFF -> BFFC++: [1.4.4.3] Internal Call:\n запись в кэш dashboard
                BFFC --> BFF--: saved
                BFFC ->> BFFCREP--: [1.4.5] streaming: репликация
            end
        BFF --> BFFISTIO--: dashboard
    BFFISTIO --> GW--: dashboard
GW --> Advertiser--: HTTPS: dashboard

== Управление кампаниями ==

Advertiser -> GW++: [1.1] POST/PATCH/DELETE/GET кампания/контент/стратегия
    GW -> CSISTIO++: [1.C.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        CSISTIO -> CSAPI++: [1.C.2] sidecar forwarding: входящий HTTP-запрос
            alt POST/PATCH/DELETE
            CSAPI -> CSBL++: [1.C.3] Internal Call: обработка и валидация изменений
                CSBL -> CSDB++: [1.C.4] JDBC write: сохранение\n сampaigns / сontents / strategies
                CSDB -> CSBL--: сохранено
                CSDB ->> CSDBREP--: [1.C.4.1] streaming: репликация
                CSBL ->> K: [1.C.5] Kafka Producer: события изменения кампаний и составляющих \n(campaign_changed / content_changed / strategy_changed)
                note right of K: см. Сценарий 5. Обновление кешей\n см. Запрос отчета
            CSBL --> CSAPI--: 200 OK
        CSAPI --> CSISTIO: response: 200 OK
            else GET
            CSAPI -> CSDBREP++: [1.C.3a] JDBC read: Получение\n сampaigns / сontents / strategies
            CSDBREP -> CSAPI--: сampaigns / сontents / strategies
        CSAPI --> CSISTIO--: response: сampaigns / сontents / strategies
            end
    CSISTIO --> GW--: response
GW --> Advertiser--: HTTPS: response

== Пополнение бюджета ==

Advertiser -> GW++: POST запрос пополнения
    GW -> FSISTIO++: HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        note left of FSISTIO: см. Сценарий 4. Финансы
    FSISTIO --> GW--: 202 Accepted
GW --> Advertiser--: 202 Accepted

== Просмотр финансов ==

Advertiser -> GW++: GET budgets / state_budgets / transactions / accounts
    GW -> FSISTIO++: HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        note left of FSISTIO: см. Сценарий 4. Финансы
    FSISTIO --> GW--: response
GW --> Advertiser--: HTTPS: response

== Запрос отчета ==

K -> AW++: [1.A(a)1] Kafka Consumer: сбор событий рекламных кампаний\n(campaign_changed / content_changed / strategy_changed /\n action_endUser / targeting_changed / state_budget_changed / transaction / contract_create / contract_deactivate / contract_completed)
    AW -> CH++: [1.A(a)2] write: батчевая запись events, aggregates
    CH --> AW--: saved events, aggregates
    AW ->> K: [1.A(a)3] Kafka Producer: событие об изменении аналитики (analytics_changed)
    note right of K: см. Сценарий 5. Обновление кешей
AW -> K--: ACK

Advertiser -> GW++: [1.1] GET: запрос отчета
    GW -> AAISTIO++: [1.A.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        AAISTIO -> AAAPI++: [1.A.2] sidecar forwarding: входящий HTTP-запрос
            AAAPI ->> RQ: [1.A.3] Queue Producer: задача формирования отчёта (report)
        AAAPI --> AAISTIO--: Accepted
    AAISTIO --> GW--: 202 Accepted
GW --> Advertiser--: 202 Accepted


RQ -> RW++: [1.A.4] Queue Consumer: задача формирования отчёта (report)
alt Timeout/Ошибка
alt После N retries
RW -> RQ: NACK + DLQ
else
RW -> RQ: NACK + requeue с backoff
end
else
    RW -> CHREP++: [1.A.5] read: events
    CHREP --> RW--: events
    RW -> RW: [1.A.5.1] формирование отчета
    RW -> CH++: [1.A.6] write: запись сформированного отчета (report)
    CH --> RW--: saved
    RW --> Advertiser: [1.A.7] уведомление о готовности отчета
RW -> RQ--: ACK
end

== Просмотр аналитики ==

CH ->> CHREP: [1.A(a).2.1]/[1.A.6.1] streaming: репликация\n (events, aggregates, reports)
Advertiser -> GW++: [1.1] GET reports / aggregates
    GW -> AAISTIO++: [1.A.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        AAISTIO -> AAAPI++: [1.A.2] sidecar forwarding: входящий HTTP-запрос
            AAAPI -> CHREP++: [1.A.3a] read
            CHREP --> AAAPI--: reports / aggregates
        AAAPI --> AAISTIO--: response: reports / aggregates
    AAISTIO --> GW--: response
GW --> Advertiser--: HTTPS: response

@enduml
